<title>CHILE: Chile February fishmeal exports fall.</title>
<headline>Chile February fishmeal exports fall.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean fishmeal exports fell in February to $25.9 million from $35.8 million in the same month last year, said the Central Bank in its fortnightly report.</p>
<p>Fishmeal exports came to $54.7 million in the first two months of the year, compared with $62.7 million in the same period 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
